":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Chihaya's older twin sister. She calls him Chii-kun and is jealous of any girl who gets near her younger twin brother. Sometimes gets angry and lectures the Jinguu sisters."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c30650"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜多家の長女にして、主人公の千早とは双子関係。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千早と同じクラスに通う学園２年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりのブラコンで、「ちーくんは私のものだから！」という溺愛ぶり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それが同い年のクラスメイトなので、学友達からはからかいの対象になっており千早にとってはちょっと複雑である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千早の前では自分のことを「お姉ちゃん」と呼ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長は高めでスレンダー系、女子力がとても高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも真っ直ぐで、躊躇がない。弟の事以外は割とサバサバしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5986","sourceWorkId":"21325","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜多家の長女にして、主人公・千早とは双子の関係（境子が姉で千早が弟）。 千早と同じクラスに通う学園2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなりのブラコンで、 「ちーくんは私のものだから！」 と公言する溺愛ぶり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千早と話す時は自分のことを “お姉ちゃん” と言う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長は高めでスレンダー系、女子力がとても高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何事にも真っ直ぐで躊躇がない。 弟のこと以外はわりとサバサバしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「結婚する？　しちゃう？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30002"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5986","sourceWorkId":"21325","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"163 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5986","sourceWorkId":"21325","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"81 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5986","sourceWorkId":"21325","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5986","sourceWorkId":"21325","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/28ff1f45aa75646e526c9ebbd219a6a94c95d687f74a6ab79860a3afe59d24d7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e78f8adf46efb0a062ae9e680cfa1f3c1bc6d92f79e3f47e34e75abd77246a7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"有河春花","creatorId":"vndb:s877","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s877","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s877","name":"春河 あかり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:118063:30002:19159:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30651","characterName":"喜多 メイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30003","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"118063"},{"characterId":"30003","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"185100"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5987"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30651"},"originalCharacterName":"喜多 メイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"804"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"147"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜多家の次女にして、千早・境子の妹。学園１年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自己主張することは少ないが言いたいことは率直に言う、芯の通ったマイペースな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に成績がよく、優等生として教師陣からの信頼もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無表情で、喋り方にも抑揚が無く常に一定。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テンションも常に一定だが、ごく稀にお茶目な面も見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄（千早）譲りの正義感を持っていて、下劣な行いに対しては感情が出る事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の事を「ボク」と呼